[B]Paper 26.1 and Folia 26.1, unpaced, 4,096 teleports per plugin.[/B] 6 GB pinned heap, every pacing knob in the harness removed ([I]dispatch-interval = 0 ms[/I], [I]per-player-gap = 0 ms[/I], [I]immediate-redispatch = true[/I]), up to 4 teleports in flight at once. 32,768 x 32,768 square border with a 1,024-block void around spawn, so every landing has to be on natural terrain; EzRTP's water-surface platform option was turned off so it plays by the same rule. BetterRTP is absent from the Folia rows because it does not run there: its PaperLib fallback calls [I]CraftWorld.getChunkAt[/I] from a global-region thread.

