Safety-critical packages inside [I]rtp-core[/I] carry higher floors on top of the module number: the teleport pipeline at 0.87 / 0.75, region selection at 0.82 / 0.68, and world-border math at 0.99 / 0.89.

[TABLE]
[TR][TH]Gate[/TH][TH]Number it enforces[/TH][TH]Where it runs[/TH][/TR]
