[TR][TD]Safety prohibitions (ArchUnit)[/TD][TD]10 rules: no unsafe destinations, no permanently force-loaded chunks, no claim bypass, no swallowed teleport failures, no main-thread chunk I/O, no null-guard no-ops on the public API, no hardcoded failure messages[/TD][TD][I]gradle.yml[/I][/TD][/TR]
